  "assessment": "All six conditions of satisfaction are met. The changes were purely additive: --store documented in the Installing section with a live example; categories listed inline in the Recording an expense section; stats and budget both gained prose explanations and example invocations appended to the Looking at your spending section; CATEGORY_BUDGETS in config.py is named explicitly so a user knows exactly where to go to change budget figures. No existing content was removed or altered."
